  1+++6478              ; Project127 shared 32-bit memory range core
  2+++6478              ; UINT32 values are little-endian. Carry set means overflow or end > capacity.
  3+++6478              ; Zero-length ranges are valid when offset <= capacity.
  4+++6478              ; Non-reentrant: each processor serializes memory API calls.
